21:["$","$Lf",null,{"maxLineCountExpression":2,"textColorExpression":"$undefined","textProps":{"fontFamily":"sans","fontSize":"small","fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"normal","lineHeight":"default","textAlign":"start","children":["I have always been an optimist. These days, though, my optimism comes with footnotes. For the first time this century, the world slipped backwards on key measures like childhood mortality in 2025, and if we don’t make the right decisions, this trend will continue.  At the same time, I also believe that, within the next decade, the world will not only get back on track but enter a new era of unprecedented progress. As we start 2026, I’m thinking about how the year ahead will position us for decades to come. "],"offsetBottom":"1x","offsetStart":"1.5x","offsetEnd":"1.5x","linkColorTokens":"$undefined","linkHoverDecoration":"none"}}]
